 .Xr chroot 8 .
+.It Fl S
+For a native Darwin staging root selected with
+.Fl P ,
+allow required system libraries present in the active dyld cache only when
+the package operating system and architecture match the running host.
+This does not enable host libraries for foreign targets.
 .It Fl p Ar prefix
 Override the prefix stored in the package with
 .Ar prefix .
